0..78 Comment "// An unwind is a shielded section: it runs to completion under the empty row,"
79..151 Comment "// which carries no abandonment, so a cancellation written inside one is"
152..223 Comment "// refused, and no cancellation reaches a cancellation already running."
225..248 Comment "// The task\'s protocol."
